  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyFlags.Http 0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n      Added\n      - Reference HTTP transport: registration plus polling value synchronization with conditional GET/ETag.\n      - Retry with jittered exponential backoff, honoring Retry-After.\n      - Strict response validation against the documented wire contract (docs/protocol.md).\n\n      Fixed\n      - README/docs still said \"not yet published to NuGet.org\" after alpha.2 had actually shipped.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha, matches TinyFlags's contract version.\n      - Upgrade TinyFlags, TinyFlags.Http and TinyFlags.Grpc together.",
